Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above covers the original work in this repository: the
simulator source code, build and generation tools, tests, documentation,
original artwork (menus, banner, icon, cockpit and airport materials, the
pixel font) and the synthesized audio.

It does NOT cover the third-party aircraft models and the files derived from
them, or the map and elevation data. Those keep their own licences and terms,
listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. All of them allow free use, including
commercial use, as long as the credits in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md are kept.
